{
  "answer": "**Merariq** 指 Sasak 族婚礼中的“**kawin lari**”（抢婚/私奔）程序：即男子在正式婚礼（伊斯兰 akad nikah）之前，把要娶的女子带走（“拐走/私奔”）——通常先将女子带到男方家或一处叫 *bale penyeboqan* 的地方安置，再进入后续的谈判、聘礼、正式婚仪等环节。\n\n依据网址：\n- https://cloud.badilag.net/s/XYnYNCxLdgbgqik/download/INDRI%20ANNISA%20HASANAH_MERARIQ%20DALAM%20PERSPEKTIF%20ADAT%20DAN%20HUKUM%20NASIONAL%20MENJAGA%20KEARIFAN%20LOKAL%20DAN%20PERLINDUNGAN%20HAK%20PEREMPUAN.pdf\n- http://download.garuda.kemdikbud.go.id/article.php?article=3242818&val=28400&title=Tradisi%20Kawin%20Lari%20Merariq%20pada%20Suku%20Bangsa%20Sasak%20di%20Desa%20Wanasaba%20Lombok%20Timur",
